Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:39:44 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 07/17] qt: follow the Omarchy font and Hyprland corner radius

OmarchyTheme gains tested parsers for fc-match and hyprctl output. With the
omarchy_default option the application font becomes the desktop monospace font and
MainCtx exposes Hyprland's decoration:rounding as omarchyRadius. VLCStyle derives its
corner radii from it (small controls capped at 4 px, panels and dialogs as is), and
keeps the stock radii when the value is unavailable.
